<title>USA: Boca Research ships 56K modems.</title>
<headline>Boca Research ships 56K modems.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boca Research Inc said on Wednesday that it shipped its first Boca 56K Internet modems, with full-production shipments expected to begin later this month.</p>
<p>The modems enable end-users to download information from the Internet over local telephone lines at speeds up to 56 kilobits per second.</p>
<p>Boca's modems are expected to retail in the $149 to $169 range.</p>
<p>Boca Reseach makes data communications, video-conferencing, multimedia and networking products.</p>
